        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1971] After receiving the AuthorizationSetupReq, the SECC shall send an AuthorizationSetupRes within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. If the AuthorizationSetupRes is sent with CertificateInstallationService set to \"False\", the next allowed request shall be AuthorizationReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                167,
                1122,
                300
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    300.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    300.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1972] After receiving the CertificateInstallationReq, if the data required for the CertificateInstallationRes is not yet available, the SECC shall respond with a CertificateInstallationRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Ongoing\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. The next allowed request shall be CertificateInstallationReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                320,
                1123,
                478
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    320.0
                ],
                [
                    1123.0,
                    320.0
                ],
                [
                    1123.0,
                    478.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    478.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1973] After receiving the CertificateInstallationReq, if the data required for the CertificateInstallationRes is available and additional contract certificate chains are available, the SECC shall respond with a CertificateInstallationRes with RemainingContractCertificateChains set to the number of remaining contract certificate chains and EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. The next allowed request shall be CertificateInstallationReq or AuthorizationReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                499,
                1123,
                710
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    499.0
                ],
                [
                    1123.0,
                    499.0
                ],
                [
                    1123.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    710.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1974] The SECC shall not provide more contract certificate chains than supported by the EVCC, which was communicated by the EVCC in the CertificateInstallationReq through the parameter MaximumContractCertificateChains.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                729,
                1122,
                810
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
