        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "V2G20-2224] After receiving the CertificateInstallationReq, if the SECC does not recognize any one (or more) of the eMSPs indicated by the EMAID included in the PrioritizedEMAIDs list the SECC shall respond with a CertificateInstallationRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\" and ResponseCode per [V2G20-2208] within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. All mandatory parameters shall be filled in with arbitrary XSD conform values. All values shall be chosen in a way that results in a minimal size of the response message. The next",
